================================================================================
ORIGINAL WORK (© VaaniEdge / IISc CI Lab)
================================================================================
All engine, DSP, and codec code under the Kotlin package `in.iisc.vaani.*` and
the native library `app/src/main/cpp/vaani_dsp_neon.cpp`, plus the host-side
pipeline in `speech_lab/`, is original first-principles work:

  * libvaani_dsp_neon.so   — custom C++17 ARM64 NEON DSP (pre-emphasis, RMS,
                             Whisper-exact log-Mel spectrogram, float->PCM16).
  * in.iisc.vaani.neural.* — ONNX Runtime inference engines (VAD, Whisper STT
                             with logit-level script masking, VITS TTS) written
                             directly against the ai.onnxruntime API.
  * in.iisc.vaani.codec.*  — Hinglish Codec + Indic Grapheme-to-Phoneme engine.
  * in.iisc.vaani.audio.*  — capture / endpointing / streaming-TTS orchestration.

